silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_04_limits_and_colimits_sections_04_colimit_worked_example_concrete_anchor_5_CareProcess#careprocess silm:hasLongDescription "The CareProcess is the recurring annual-vaccination care process Mittens participates in as a pet. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'CareProcess', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
